UPDATE companies SET description='FabArc Steel Supply, Inc. was founded in 1979 in Oxford, Alabama. The company operates as a structural steel fabricator with three manufacturing plants in Oxford and Decatur, Alabama.

The company fabricates structural steel for building structures, bridges, and pressure vessels. Its facilities encompass over 435,000 square feet of fabrication space and employ more than 300 workers. Annual production capacity exceeds 50,000 tons. Processes include CNC sawing and drilling, beam processing, plasma and oxy-fuel cutting, shot blasting, cambering, sub-arc welding, and plate processing.

FabArc serves the automotive, commercial construction, healthcare construction, and industrial construction sectors across the Southeast.

The company emphasizes fast-track project support, backed by a bonding capacity of $175 million per project and $300 million aggregate. A bar-coded inventory and production control system supports on-time delivery.', certifications=ARRAY['AISC Standard for Steel Building Structures','AISC Fracture Critical Endorsement','AISC Simple Steel Bridges','ASME Boiler and Pressure Vessel Code','AISC Sophisticated Paint Coating Endorsement','Small Business Certification (DUN #029972684)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Structural steel fabrication", "Plate girder fabrication", "ASME code pressure vessel fabrication", "CNC sawing and drilling", "CNC horizontal band sawing", "Shot blasting", "Cambering", "Plasma/oxy-fuel cutting", "Plasma table cutting", "Punch duplicating", "Sub-arc welding", "Beam processing (Lincoln Python X)", "High-definition plasma cutting (MESSER TITAN III)", "Material handling (cranes, forklifts, trailers)", "Bar-coded inventory and production control"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Commercial construction", "Healthcare construction", "Industrial construction", "Pressure vessel fabrication"], "materials": ["Carbon steel", "Stainless steel", "Nickel alloys", "Chromium alloys", "Titanium", "Aluminum"], "equipment": ["Peddinghaus CNC saw and drill systems", "Hydmech CNC horizontal band saws", "Shot blasters", "Camber machines", "Plasma/oxy-fuel punch and plate processing equipment", "Plasma table", "Peddinghaus punch duplicator", "Sub-arc welding equipment for plate girders", "Taylor forklifts (36,000 lb capacity)", "Combi-lift (36,000 lb capacity)", "Grove crane (80 ton)", "Road trailers (60+)", "Lincoln Python X Beam Processing system", "MESSER TITAN III Cutting System", "Overhead cranes (70 ton and 40 ton)"], "volume": "Over 50,000 tons annually", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Fast-track project support with urgent delivery capability", "Pre-approved $175 million single-project and $300 million aggregate bonding capacity", "Sup