UPDATE companies SET description='FabWeld Co. operates from Kailua, Hawaii, where it was founded in 1986. The company is a Woman Veteran-Owned Small Business, rooted in values of craftsmanship and integrity.

The shop provides custom fabrication and welding services, including CNC plasma cutting, plate laser cutting, water jet cutting, laser tube cutting, EDM machining, CNC machining, ferrous and non-ferrous sawing, multiple welding processes (GTAW, SMAW, GMAW, FCAW), tube and pipe bending and rolling, sheet and plate bending, CAD design, prototype work, and repairs. It works with materials such as stainless steels, mild steel, aluminum, chrome-moly, brass, cast iron, titanium, Inconel, and composites.

FabWeld serves federal and state government agencies, commercial, industrial, residential, and retail clients, as well as the food processing and marine industries. Notable projects include high-end custom work for brands such as Louis Vuitton and Harry Winston, along with food service equipment, truck upfitting, motorcycle, and automotive fabrication for clients throughout Honolulu and greater Oahu.

The company emphasizes a build-to-last philosophy, using American-made materials whenever possible and pricing based on time, skill, and care rather than low-bid competition. Its stated mission is to "build it once, build it right, and build it to last," reflecting a commitment to durability over disposability.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["CNC Plasma Cutting", "Plate Laser Cutting", "Water Jet Cutting", "Laser Tube Cutting", "EDM Machining", "CNC Machining", "Ferrous/Non-Ferrous Sawing", "GTAW (TIG) Welding", "SMAW (Stick) Welding", "GMAW (MIG) Welding", "FCAW/Dual Shield (Flux Core) Welding", "Tube/Pipe Bending", "Tube/Pipe Rolling", "Sheet/Plate Bending", "CAD Design", "Prototype Work", "Repairs", "Custom Fabrication & Welding", "Food Service Equipment Fabrication"], "industries": ["Federal Government Agencies", "State Government Agencies", "Commercial", "Industrial", "Residential", "Retail", "Food Processing/Manufacturing", "Marine Industry", "Food Service Equipment", "Truck Upfitting", "Motorcycles", "Automotive"], "materials": ["Stainless Steels", "Mild Steel", "Aluminum", "Chrome-Moly", "Brass", "Cast Iron", "Titanium", "Inconel", "Composites"], "equipment": ["CNC Plasma Cutting", "Plate Laser Cutting", "Water Jet Cutting", "Laser Tube Cutting", "EDM Machining", "CNC Machining", "Ferrous/Non-Ferrous Sawing"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Woman Veteran-Owned Small Business", "Prioritizes American-made materials", "Federal government contracting experience", "High-end custom projects for luxury brands (Louis Vuitton, Harry Winston)", "Build-to-last philosophy over low-bid approach"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1986 -> db", "Headquarters Kailua, Hawaii -> db", "Woman Veteran-Owned Small Business -> page \"/\"", "Services: CNC plasma cutting, plate laser cutting, water jet cutting, laser tube cutting, EDM machining, CNC machining, ferrous/non-ferrous sawing, welding processes (GTAW, SMAW, GMAW, FCAW),