UPDATE companies SET description='Triangle Electric, Inc. was founded in 1946 by Harold Hoffelt, Oscar Stenehjem, and Selmer Johnson as a family-owned electrical contractor in Minot, North Dakota. The company established a second location in Williston, ND, and has remained locally owned and operated since its inception.

