UPDATE companies SET description='KSM Metal Fabrication was founded in 1986 in Troy, Ohio, just north of Dayton. The company operates as a woman-owned business from a 27,000-square-foot facility in Miami County.

The shop specializes in low-volume, short-run, and prototype metal fabrication, offering services such as laser cutting, shearing, forming, welding (TIG, MIG, seam, spot, and sanitary), and assembly. It also coordinates partner services for heat treating, CNC machining (milling, turning, EDM), metal spinning, plating, anodizing, and powder coating. Typical production runs range from 25 to 1,000 pieces, with prototypes delivered in days.

KSM serves the aerospace, food equipment, and automotive industries. In aerospace, it has over 40 years of experience fabricating heat shields for aircraft wheels and brakes. For food equipment manufacturers, it produces custom stainless-steel fabrications meeting cGMP requirements, including carts, guards, tables, and conveying systems. Automotive customers rely on KSM for low-volume production parts, fixtures, and prototypes.

The company emphasizes quick turnaround—citing over 99% on-time delivery—and design-for-manufacturability consultation to reduce costs. Its certifications include ITAR, AS9100:2016 Rev D, and ISO 9001:2015.', certifications=ARRAY['ITAR','AS9100:2016 Rev D','ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom metal fabrication", "Laser cutting", "Shearing", "Forming", "Welding (TIG, MIG, seam, spot, sanitary)", "Assembly", "Prototyping", "Reverse engineering", "On-site design consultation", "Manufacturing efficiency consultation", "Heat treating (via partners)", "CNC milling (via partners)", "CNC turning (via partners)", "EDM (via partners)", "Metal spinning (via partners)", "Plating (via partners)", "Polishing (via partners)", "Anodizing (via partners)", "Powder coating (via partners)"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Food Equipment", "Automotive"], "materials": ["Aluminum", "Brass", "Copper", "Galvanized Steel", "Mild Steel", "Pre-painted Steel", "Stainless Steel", "Carbon Steel"], "equipment": ["10'' Accurshear"], "volume": "Short-run production, typically 25\u20131,000 pieces; prototypes in days", "lead_time": "Prototypes in days; over 99% on-time delivery", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Over 99% on-time delivery", "Prototypes delivered in days, not weeks", "Design-for-manufacturability and reverse engineering support", "Woman-owned, ISO 9001:2015 and AS9100:2016 Rev D certified", "Single-source coordination for fabrication, machining, and finishing"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1986 -> db", "Headquarters Troy, Ohio -> db", "Woman-owned business -> /about-us", "27,000 sq. ft. facility -> /about-us", "ITAR, AS9100:2016 Rev D, ISO 9001:2015 certifications -> /about-us", "Industries: Aerospace, Food Equipment, Automotive -> / and /about-us", "Aerospace: heat shields for aircraft wheels and brakes, over 40 years experience -> /", "Food Equipment: custom stainless steel fabrication to cGMP for carts, guards, tables, conveying systems -> /", "Automotive: low volum