UPDATE companies SET description='M.A.R.''s Engineering Company has operated from San Leandro, California since 1964. The family-owned business began as a precision screw machining shop and has remained under family stewardship for nearly six decades.

The company specializes in high-accuracy turned components, running 35 Brown & Sharpe single-spindle screw machines capable of up to five simultaneous operations. Its capabilities extend to multi-spindle screw machining, centerless grinding, CNC milling and water jetting, CNC turning, wire EDM, and in-house finishing — including plating (hard chrome, zinc, black oxide, nickel, gold, Teflon), polishing, and light assembly. A workforce of 50–99 employees handles prototype through production volumes in a single facility.

M.A.R.''s serves aerospace, medical, electronics, automotive, chip manufacturing, food processing, heating and cooling, transportation, electrical/utilities, and music industries. Customers range from OEMs requiring complex prototypes to those needing large production runs of precision parts.

The company emphasizes a quality system built on dual order review, first-article inspection of five to eight pieces per setup, and a three-stage in-process monitoring method where operators batch parts for dimensional verification. Inspectors walk the line twice daily to confirm conformance.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Single Spindle Screw Machining", "Multi-Spindle Screw Machining", "Centerless Grinding", "CNC Milling", "Water Jetting", "CNC Turning", "Wire EDM", "Finishing", "Plating (Hard Chrome, Zinc, Black Oxide, Nickel, Gold, Teflon)", "Polishing", "Light Assembly"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Medical", "Electronics", "Automotive", "Chip Manufacturing", "Food Processing", "Heating and Cooling", "Transportation", "Electrical/Utilities", "Music"], "materials": ["Aluminum", "Stainless Steel", "Tool Steel", "Hardened Steel", "Hard Chrome", "Exotic Metals", "Plastics", "Conductive Materials"], "equipment": ["Brown & Sharpe Single-Spindle Screw Machines (35)", "CNC Milling Machines", "Centerless Grinders", "Wire EDM Machine"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned and operated since 1964", "35 Brown & Sharpe single-spindle screw machines performing up to five operations at once", "In-house plating (hard chrome, zinc, black oxide, nickel, gold, Teflon), polishing, and light assembly", "Three-stage in-process inspection with inspectors walking the line twice daily", "Prototyping through production completed in one facility"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1964 in San Leandro, California -> db", "Family-owned -> / (Why Work with M.A.R.''s section)", "35 Brown & Sharpe single-spindle screw machines -> / (Single Spindle Screw Machining section)", "Multi-spindle screw machining, centerless grinding, CNC milling, water jetting, CNC turning, wire EDM -> / (Services & Capabilities sections)", "In-house finishing, plating (hard chrome, zinc, black oxide, nickel, gold, Teflon), polishing, light asse