UPDATE companies SET description='MBS Fabrication, Inc. operates from Southbridge, Massachusetts, where it was founded in 1997 as a woman-owned business.

The shop combines CNC machining, welding, and sheet metal fabrication to produce precision components and sub-assemblies such as cap and baffle assemblies, tube and housing sub-assemblies, dynamic plate sub-assemblies, and effusion plate sub-assemblies. Its quality assurance personnel inspect every part to verify conformance to customer requirements, drawing on a team whose combined experience exceeds 100 years.

MBS states its mission is to create products held to the highest standards, meet or exceed customer expectations, continuously improve, and deliver jobs on time, every time. This commitment to craftsmanship and timeliness has been the foundation of its reputation for over 25 years.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','AS9100:2016','NADCAP Nonconventional Machining','NADCAP Welding']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Sheet metal fabrication", "Forming", "CNC machining", "Welding", "Precision assembly", "Sub-assembly manufacturing", "Quality inspection"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Defense"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Close-tolerance sheet metal fabrication, forming, and machining", "Over 100 years of combined staff experience in CNC machining, welding, and fabrication", "100% part inspection by dedicated quality assurance personnel", "ISO 9001:2015 and AS9100:2016 certified quality management system", "NADCAP accreditation for nonconventional machining and welding"], "facts_used": ["Woman-owned company founded in 1997 -> /about-us", "Headquarters at 270 Ashland Avenue, Southbridge, MA 01550 -> /", "Specialists in close tolerance sheet metal fabrication, forming, and machining -> /about-us", "Staff has over 100 years combined experience in CNC machining, welding, and sheet metal fabrication -> /about-us", "Quality assurance personnel inspect each part -> /about-us", "ISO 9001:2015 certified -> /about-us", "AS9100:2016 certified -> /about-us", "NADCAP Nonconventional Machining certification -> /about-us", "NADCAP Welding certification -> /about-us", "Products include Cap & Baffle Assembly, Tube/Housing Sub-Assembly, Dynamic Plate Sub-Assembly, Baffle Sub-Assembly, Effusion Plate Sub-Assembly -> /", "Mission: create products to highest standards, meet/exceed expectations, continuous improvement, on-time delivery -> /about-us", "Quality Manager Shane Szall featured in Quality Manager''s Alert 