UPDATE companies SET description='Metro Medical Equipment & Supply, Inc. is headquartered in St. Ann, Missouri. Founded in 1985, the company has served federal, state, and local government healthcare facilities for decades. In 2015, Karen Moore assumed ownership and now leads as President and CEO. The business is certified as a woman-owned small business and also operates as a minority-owned enterprise.

The company distributes medical equipment and supplies from established manufacturers to government buyers. Its services include contract management, lead generation, solicitation support, and regulatory compliance guidance (FAR/DFARS/VFAR, BAA/TAA). Metro Medical acts as a bridge between medical device manufacturers and government procurement offices, handling communication, quote preparation, and order fulfillment. The team uses customized software for competitive and historic sales analysis to identify opportunities.

Primary customers are U.S. government healthcare facilities, including VA Medical Centers, military hospitals, Indian Health Service centers, the National Institutes of Health, and other federal, state, and local agencies. Product categories span sports medicine and orthopedics, ophthalmology, trauma and battlefield equipment, cardiology, audiology, hematology, durable medical equipment, and imaging supplies. The firm also represents manufacturers in electromedical apparatus, surgical instruments, and medical wholesale distribution.

Metro Medical emphasizes its expertise in government procurement regulations and contract vehicles, positioning itself as a small-business link that helps manufacturers navigate federal acquisition requirements.', certifications=ARRAY['DFARS','WOMAN-OWNED']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Contract Management", "Lead Generation", "Solicitation Identification and Response", "Government Quote Preparation", "Communication Coordination Between Customers and Manufacturers", "Regulatory Compliance Guidance (FAR/DFARS/VFAR, BAA/TAA)", "Competitive Landscape Analytics", "Procurement Opportunity Monitoring", "Small Business Government Link Services"], "industries": ["VA Medical Centers", "Military Hospitals", "Indian Health Service Centers", "National Institutes of Health", "Federal Government Healthcare Facilities", "State and Local Government Healthcare Facilities", "Sports Medicine and Orthopedics", "Ophthalmology", "Trauma and Battlefield Medical Equipment", "Cardiology", "Audiology", "Hematology", "Durable Medical Equipment", "Medical Imaging Equipment and Supplies", "Electromedical and Electrotherapeutic Apparatus Manufacturing", "Surgical and Medical Instrument Manufacturing", "Medical, Dental, and Hospital Equipment and Supplies Merchant Wholesalers"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Dedicated contract specialists knowledgeable in diverse contract vehicles", "Customized software for competitive and historic sales analysis", "Insight on FARS/DFARS/VFAR regulations and BAA/TAA product compliance", "Small business link to government facilities", "Responsive partner support and communication coordination"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1985 -> db", "Headquarters St. Ann, Missouri -> db", "Karen Moore President & CEO, ownership since 2015 -> /", "Woman-owned, minority-owned small business -> /about", "DFARS and WOMAN-OWNED certifications -> db", "Distributes to VA Medical Centers, Military Hospitals, Indian H