UPDATE companies SET description='Mills Industries has operated from Laconia, New Hampshire since its founding in 1972. The company remains family owned and operated, now spanning four generations of the Mills family. It began as a packaging operation and has evolved into a specialist in corrugated plastic solutions.

The company designs and manufactures custom corrugated plastic packaging for a range of applications. Its product lines include marketing and display packaging, trays and totes, industrial containers and material handling systems, plastic partitions and parts dividers, collapsible boxes and cartons, and specialized packaging for life sciences and cleanroom environments.

Mills Industries serves customers in life sciences, cleanroom manufacturing, industrial manufacturing, material handling, and marketing and display sectors.

